meta { title = "Kalandra 0.99.3 — language and standard-library foundations", description = "Local mutation, lazy generators, explicit returns, generics and traits, host I/O, and broader GPU language support.", order = 0, group = "Release archive" }

Kalandra 0.99.3 completes the core language milestone: checked local mutation, expression-valued control flow, lazy generators, explicit returns, static generics and traits, practical host I/O, and broader GPU language support. This page covers changes since 0.99.2.

This release changes source syntax and application entry behavior. Read the migration section before rebuilding older programs. The compiler and native language server report 0.99.3; the separately versioned VS Code extension is 0.2.0.

list {
